[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4600544445","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119932#issuecomment-4600544445","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119932","id":4600544445,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEja8vQ","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T08:50:25Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T08:59:12Z","body":"> This still produces an object (although not an instance of the script). `CALL_ERROR_INVALID_METHOD` falls back to calling on the native class which creates a `RefCounted` instance in this case.\r\n\r\nGood catch!\r\n\r\n> I'm also not sure about this returning an error method thing. This works when using the methodbind from the GDScriptVM. But couldn't it mess up extensions?\r\n\r\nThe calling convention implies that if call error is not `CALL_OK`, then the return value should not be used as the expected one (and in GDScript it is used to pass the error message instead). Is there a chance to mess up? Yes, if you don't follow the convention. But if I'm not mistaken, in godot-cpp users rarely deal with `CallError` (the most common is probably binding variadic methods)?\r\n\r\nIf you prefer, we can defer this part to 4.8 to minimize risks. The only downside is that users will see two errors instead of one. The first one (`Invalid call. Nonexistent function 'method_name'.`) can be confusing, and the second one (`ERR_FAIL_*`) is hard to notice because it's hidden in the Errors tab and doesn't cause the debugger to stop.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4600544445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4600779394","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119932#issuecomment-4600779394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119932","id":4600779394,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEjpSgg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T09:06:31Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T09:06:31Z","body":"Ah yeah my bad. I misread `bind_vararg_method` and thought it dropped the call error. But since it maps into the method bind it should be fine.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4600779394/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4601791462","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119932#issuecomment-4601791462","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119932","id":4601791462,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEknD5g","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T11:11:25Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T11:11:25Z","body":"Looks fine to me. However if possible I'd like for the core team to confirm the use of `CALL_ERROR_INVALID_METHOD` in this situation. From what I've seen in the codebase this code is regularly used to indicate the absence of a method, so it might be more appropriate to add a new code `ERROR_INVALID_STATE`. After all the `new` method exists on all GDScripts from the ClassDB perspective.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4601791462/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4959802283","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119932#issuecomment-4959802283","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119932","id":4959802283,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ6CTqw","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T15:45:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T15:45:19Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"htt